2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857719 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:225 "*** Reference: GSM 04.08 " & char(0, 0, 0, 167) & "3.4.4, TC_26_6_5_7 ***"
2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857741 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:226 *** Purpose: Verify MS reports time difference (motdif) after non-sync HO ***
2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857747 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:227 *** TWO_CELL: ARFCN 51 (Cell A main BTS) + ARFCN 56 (Cell B n56 BTS) ***
2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857752 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:228 *** FH-SKIP: C_Test_fh preamble and TCH hopping approximated as h=0 fixed ***
2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857757 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:229 ==========================================================
2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857762 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:230 *** Spec comments: ***
2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857768 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:231 ***   1. Cell A with BCCH, CCCH, SDCCH4 and a traffic channel ***
2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857773 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:232 ***   2. Cell B with BCCH, CCCH, SDCCH4 and a traffic channel ***
2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857778 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:233 ***   3. In cell A the timing advance = TSPX_y3 (=20) ***
2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857783 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:234 ***   4. non-synch, rot=1, nci=0, handover reference = TSPX_HoRefB ***
2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857788 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:235 ==========================================================
2026/Jun/29 06:25:00.857793 USER TC_26_6_5_7.ttcn3:240 *** FH-SKIP: Spec uses C_Test_fh (hopping channel). Virtual BTS enforces h=0 (fixed channel). ***
